</div>
<div class="footer" data-v-5880bd4d data-v-22749a4d>
<p data-v-22749a4d>Need a hand? <a href="{{store.helpUrl}}" data-v-22749a4d>Visit the help centre</a> or reply to this email.</p>
<tddr-if test="store.code == 'uk'">
<p data-v-22749a4d>Oakline Home Ltd · 3 Tannery Lane, Bristol BS1 6QH · VAT GB 284 1190 32</p>
